<title>JAPAN: Lasertec - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Lasertec - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.39		vs	    2.05</p>
